                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNGEN, SYSTEME UND VERFAHREN ZUR DREHMOMENTVERSTÄRKUNG IN MEDIZINISCHEN SYSTEMEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIFS, SYSTÈMES ET PROCÉDÉS D'AMPLIFICATION DE COUPLE DANS DES SYSTÈMES MÉDICAUX</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DEVICES, SYSTEMS, AND METHODS FOR TORQUE AMPLIFICATION IN MEDICAL SYSTEMS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a torque amplification system configured for use within a medical device, including a driveshaft configured to be coupled to a motor, a spring coupled to the driveshaft and configured to move relative to the driveshaft, a hammer moveably coupled to the driveshaft, and an anvil configured to be coupled to an end effector and abutting the hammer, wherein the anvil is configured to provide a rotational power output to the end effector.</p>
            </abstract>
